```console
$ scherzo-cloud connection linear authorization create --help
Create a Linear authorization session

Usage: scherzo-cloud connection linear authorization create [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --connection-id <CONNECTION>     Existing Linear connection ID to reauthorize; omit to connect a new workspace
      --timeout <DURATION>             Stop waiting after a positive duration (units: ms, s, m, or h)
      --no-wait                        Return after starting consent instead of waiting for the callback
      --json                           Emit newline-delimited JSON events
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
